			text = [=[When {link:maurin-bonesplitter}Maurin{/link}'s scrying showed the image of {link:lord-azrethoc}Lord Azrethoc{/link}, Takata saw at once that the demon was stronger than his warlock companion. He longed to face the creature himself, but his post held him fast, and to leave it would have shamed his clan. So he sent others south to {link:mannoroc-coven}Mannoroc Coven{/link}, and when they returned victorious, he dared to hope that the {link:horde}Horde{/link} might one day have a place it could safely call home.]=],
